<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to retender for 68,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to retender for 68,000 tonnes U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan Flour Mills Association will retender on April 23 for two shipments of U.S. wheat totalling 68,000 tonnes, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The association had passed on the tender on Tuesday due to high prices.</p>
</text>
